### 1. 即时搜索：全文 + 最近 7 天 + 情感/风险过滤
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search/articles/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keywords": "深圳+(男生|男性)",
  "excludeKeywords": "招聘|广告",
  "nearSlop": 7,
  "searchScope": "FULL_TEXT",
  "timeRange": "LAST_7_DAYS",
  "sources": ["微博", "新闻"],
  "emotions": ["负面"],
  "riskLevels": ["关注风险", "重点关注"],
  "page": 1,
  "size": 20,
  "sortBy": "created_at",
  "sortOrder": "desc",
  "highlight": true
}

### 2. 即时搜索：按标题搜索 + 自定义时间
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search/articles/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keywords": "深圳*男生",
  "searchScope": "TITLE",
  "timeRange": "CUSTOM",
  "startTime": "2026-11-01",
  "endTime": "2026-11-15",
  "page": 1,
  "size": 20,
  "sortBy": "_score",
  "sortOrder": "desc"
}

### 3. 创建监测分组
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "东莞企业"
}

### 4. 监测分组列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/groups?keyword=东莞&page=1&size=20

### 5. 监测分组详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/groups/1

### 6. 更新监测分组
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/groups/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "东莞重点企业"
}

### 7. 删除监测分组
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/groups/1

### 8. 创建监测设置
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 1,
  "monitorType": 1,
  "name": "深圳男生舆情",
  "keywords": "深圳+(男生|男性)",
  "excludeKeywords": "招聘|广告",
  "config": {}
}

### 8.1 创建信息源监测设置（抖音 + 微博）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 1,
  "monitorType": 2,
  "name": "双平台信息源监测",
  "config": {
    "siteIds": [1, 4]
  }
}

### 9. 监测设置列表（可按类型过滤）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/settings?groupId=1&monitorType=2&keyword=信息源&page=1&size=20

### 10. 监测设置详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/settings/1

### 11. 更新监测设置
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/settings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": 1,
  "monitorType": 1,
  "name": "深圳男生舆情",
  "keywords": "深圳+(男生|男性)",
  "excludeKeywords": "招聘|广告|中介",
  "config": {}
}

### 12. 执行监测设置：最近 24 小时 + 负面信息
POST http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/settings/1/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timeRange": "LAST_24_HOURS",
  "emotions": ["负面"],
  "riskLevels": ["关注风险", "重点关注"],
  "page": 1,
  "size": 20,
  "sortBy": "created_at",
  "sortOrder": "desc",
  "highlight": true
}

### 13. 删除监测设置
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/monitor/settings/1
